ok - watcher: an idle ship refused by its provider moves on its first idle poll, from the screen or the hook record; prose and a hook-recorded ordinary stop do not
ok - watcher: idle captain 429, billing, and usage-limit screens with open goals hand off in one poll
ok - watcher: a due P0 alarm does not stop an idle refused captain from moving in the same poll
